+# Developmental execution apparatus
+
+This package adds an intact-P execution path beside `loom_commissioning`. It does not edit `loom_p`, the Base World configuration, or historical apparatus. It is not a controller and does not create a population or choose births. Engineering authorization: Jason's 29 September 2026 developmental-runner optimization request. Scientific execution requires a separate reviewed exact grant; none is supplied here.
+
+## Execution and custody
+
+`loom_developmental.runner.Life` owns one append-only evidence directory. It binds the frozen P code/configuration, apparatus files, Python/runtime libraries, exact initial causal state, absolute native deadline, resource envelope, checkpoint policy and preceding receipt. An engineering grant additionally requires a disclosed manufactured fixture and binds the engineering request by SHA-256. A future `developmental-intact-P` grant requires a separate exact approval scope; this build creates none.
+
+`Life.advance()` calls `core.step`, preserving the existing `_coupled` and handoff operations, operation order, RNG schedule, native/wave/field cadence and terminal bisection. Native rollback copies only mutating state; a wave boundary additionally copies the association/regulator structures. Rare terminal root finding retains complete candidate copies. No observer or external-controller callback is accepted in this execution path.
+
+`Engine.last_native` becomes a small observer cache. It has no causal consumer in P. Every other Engine field, including every organism field, is included in exact equivalence comparisons. The original `Engine` implementation is preserved unchanged.
+
+Default recording: 100-step chunks, full checkpoints every 6,000 native steps and at birth/pause/stage/terminal boundaries, lossless zlib level 1. Each file is created exclusively, flushed and atomically closed; partial files and incomplete faults prevent automatic continuation. A receipt chains segment metadata and closed chunk/checkpoint hashes. A shared content-addressed identity document replaces per-life source copies; the frozen code/runtime must remain available separately.
+
+Native rows preserve endpoint raw sensory channels, actual commands/body/E/I/stocks/mover/field diagnostics and RNG counters. The initial checkpoint's raw input plus preceding endpoint readings recover every input actually received by P. Physical event records preserve substep timing, exchange, contacts, impulses and source/integrity accounting. Wave rows retain actual compact packet/context/return/credit/control/use/change summaries. Dense evolving matrices are checkpointed and exactly reconstructible from lived inputs.
+
+Cheap native finiteness, sequence and physical ledger checks remain online. Complete state/config validation occurs at segment boundaries; whole-file verification is post-run. No GUI, browser, charts, old cumulative sensory-history copies, live detached D5 calculation or ZIP work occurs during a life. The small receipt index grows linearly in the number of chunks; native payload buffering is bounded to one chunk. There is no growing whole-history serialization loop.
+
+## Pause and continuation
+
+`close('administrative_pause')` seals the current partial chunk and exact state. `Life.continue_life(store, grant)` verifies the prior store and requires the exact preceding final-state hash, parent receipt, same life identifier and exact runtime/apparatus identity. It reuses the same directory and appends a new segment. Absolute deadlines 60,000 → 90,000 → 180,000 represent total ages 600 → 900 → 1,800 seconds under the unchanged native cadence. Learned/transient state, fields, stocks, E/I, body, phase, absolute time and RNG are loaded; no constructor for a new organism/world is invoked.
+
+Terminal or failure states cannot continue. A resource pause is administrative; it is not a biological terminal. A recorder exception creates an incomplete apparatus-failure record with a best-effort unclosed tail. Such a failure is not automatically resumable. Wall/storage limits are checked before each step, with a 16 MB closure reserve. They are administrative limits with bounded step/closure overhead, not a hard operating-system disk quota.
+
+## Read-only analysis
+
+`verify_store(path)` checks complete segment custody, hashes, sequences and physical accounting without advancing P or a world.
+
+`replay.reconstruct(path, first_index=..., last_index=..., deep=..., fields=...)` reads the nearest preceding checkpoint and only relevant chunks. It replays P against saved actual inputs, never advances body physics, and compares actual commands, compact wave outputs, RNG and chunk-end P hashes. Optional field reconstruction uses the saved actual body/stocks/times and original solver, and checks saved field hashes. Optional deep diagnostics invoke the original passive/D5 routines on detached reconstructed states. Diagnostic callbacks receive detached objects only.
+
+Analysis apparatus may change while the saved causal code, recorded numerical runtime and schema must match. The record and analysis identities are both returned. Live continuation is stricter: it requires the entire original apparatus/runtime identity. Historical engineering files made before Python-DLL binding retain their original, explicitly narrower runtime manifest; they are never silently rebound.
+
+Deep analysis can incur up to one checkpoint interval of neural/field warm-up. It does not decompress an entire life to inspect a small interval. Freeze the numerical environment for bit-exact reconstruction. The binary format has a class allowlist, no pickle/eval, size/depth bounds, and rejects trailing/truncated/corrupt data. It is an integrity format, not protection against a malicious machine owner.
+
+## Engineering checks
+
+The test folder is `tests_developmental`. Tests accept `LOOM_ENGINEERING_CACHE` (the preserved lawful phase-0 prehistory cache) and `LOOM_ENGINEERING_REQUEST` (the engineering authorization text). They use only disclosed `loom_p.smokes` fixtures, never Founder starts. Use a fresh writable pytest base directory and disable the cache provider. Running these tests evolves short manufactured fixtures and therefore remains an engineering action, not a passive viewer.
+
+The review package contains measurements, complete benchmark records, source identities, development failures, exact old/lean comparisons and the resource projection. The single longer benchmark was 600 seconds. Clock/continuation boundaries around 900 and 1,800 seconds were manufactured short checks; no 1,800-second life or scientific population was run.
